      "writtenOn": "2019-04-02T21:34:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We sure can guarantee it with the current state: the cache size is less than 12K, the flash space allotted for NVMEM storage is 20K, out of which 1K is left for (key, value) pairs, i.e. 19K. We start compaction if there are 2 pages left, i.e. compaction starts at 15K boundary - how can this not fit?\n\nI added a build assert in the beginning of the file.",
      "parentUuid": "4eeea253_5b4fe29c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 905,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 905,
        "endChar": 27
      },
